{"ref":"BDB, זֶ֫רֶם","hw":"זֶ֫רֶם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זֶ֫רֶם</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:10\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.10\">Hb. 3:10</a> <strong>flood of rain, rain-storm, downpour (</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">זַרְמִית</span> <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.6\">Is 4:6</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">זָ֑רֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.2\">Is 32:2</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a> + 4 times; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.6\">Is 4:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָטָר</span>)); <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.2\">Is 28:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:10\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.10\">Hb 3:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ הָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a>, i.e. such as falls among mts. cf. Di; <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ בָּרָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.2\">Is 28:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֶה מִזֶּרֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">25:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרֶם קִיר</span> v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.4\">4</a> i.e. such as dashes against a wall, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.2\">32:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּחַ</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶפֶץ וָזֶרֶם וְאֶבֶן בָּרָד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:30\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.30\">30:30</a>.","next":"BDB, זִרְמָה","prev":"BDB, זָרַם"}